OL,3,GNEWSACouncil 'working towards' flyover
OL,4,Aroad's reopening
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is "working towards
OL,7,Freopening" a road following the
OL,8,Fdemolition of an unsafe flyover that
OL,9,Fran above, but it has told drivers more
OL,10,Fneeds to be done to assess the route's
OL,11,Fcondition before a decision is made.
OL,13,FWork to knock down Gateshead's A167
OL,14,FFlyover was completed in late September
OL,15,Ffollowing its closure in December 2024
OL,16,Fon safety grounds.
OL,18,FCampaigners argue the closure of a
OL,19,Fstretch of road running between Park
OL,20,FLane and Five Bridges has led to a
OL,21,F"seemingly endless battle with traffic
OL,22,Fbottlenecks".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
