OL,3,GNEWSACouncil 'working towards' flyover
OL,4,Aroad's reopening
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response, Gateshead Council leader
OL,7,FNick Allan said it was important to
OL,8,Funderstand what any reopening proposals
OL,9,F"would mean for the wider highway
OL,10,Fnetwork".
